    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The M-90 Indra is the only fully automatic sniper rifle in standard production, a design compromise that sacrifices per-shot stopping power to give snipers the ability to engage multiple targets without repositioning. Its twenty-round heat sink allows sustained precision fire at extreme range, making it particularly effective against lightly armored enemies that conventional snipers would waste a full-cycle reload on. Unusual enough in principle to be genuinely surprising in action.</p>"
